Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat:=20replace=20nuclear=20hero=20scene=20with?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=205-phase=20data-storage=20A=E2=86=92B=20story?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Refactor HeroCanvas3D into 5 phase-driven groups, each a self-contained
THREE.Group with its own update(delta, elapsed, weight) function:

  1. chaosGroup        — Data Crisis: tumbling particles, broken cables,
                          pulsing red warning lights, tilted broken rack
  2. assessmentGroup   — Assessment: holographic wireframe blueprint,
                          vertical scanner beam (custom GLSL sweep shader)
  3. recommendGroup    — Recommend: 3 floating vendor cards (QNAP/Dell/HPE)
                          with canvas-rendered labels, orbital animation
  4. deployGroup       — Deploy: data_center_rack.glb + 6 storage units
                          sliding in with stagger, cables plugging in,
                          LEDs going amber → green
  5. supportGroup      — Support: network_server_rack.glb + animated data
                          streams (GLSL flow shader), 4 holographic metric
                          panels, floating remote-hand glyph, counter-
                          rotating shield rings

Scroll progress (0→1) drives a Gaussian-falloff phaseProgress() that
returns per-phase weights; the camera travels X: -30 → +30 with a
gentle push-in mid-path. Lighting is dynamic: warm/red at phase 1,
cool/blue at phase 5. All animations are weight-gated so they only
play when the user is near that phase.

Adds dataStorageScene token group (rack frame/panel/edge, QNAP/Dell/HPE
vendor accents, status LED colors, data stream color, warm/cool key
lights) so the scene is fully themeable from design-tokens.ts.
